# CODEOWNERS — autom8y-asana
#
# Closes the named-owner gap recorded at
# `.ledge/decisions/DESIGN-re2-two-layer-authz-2026-08-13.md` §6:
#
#   "Named-owner gap found (and it is this design's own): autom8y-asana has no
#    CODEOWNERS file at origin/main (verified NULL at both CODEOWNERS and
#    .github/CODEOWNERS). The layer-1 owner is therefore imputed, not
#    mechanically derived."
#
# Before this file, layer-1 ownership of the Asana write surface was an
# INFERENCE (drawn from the `owner: platform-team` stamp on asana-related
# service accounts in the monorepo's services/auth/service-accounts.yaml).
# After it, ownership is a mechanical fact resolvable by tooling — which is
# what makes every other owner-of-record claim in the RE-2 build auditable
# rather than asserted.
#
# Mirrors the monorepo convention at autom8y `CODEOWNERS:1` (`* @autom8y/platform-team`).

# Default owner for everything in this repository.
*                                       @autom8y/platform-team

